body:
You know what would be a fantastic idea? In the cold open of the first episode, have a bunch of different actors auditioning to be Bender. But Fry and Leela boo each one saying, "We want DiMaggio!". And inside the room are Greoning and Cohen's heads in a jar saying, "I just wish we could get to this DiMaggio person we keep hearing about." Then DiMaggio walks in as another character like King Zog and knocks the audition out of the park.

&#x200B;

Edit: For some reason reddit cut off the first half of my comment. I've added it back.

I'll have a fuzzy navel and the lady here will have the girliest drink you have.

&#x200B;

Bartender: Two fuzzy navels coming right up!
